# Project Contract

## Project Overview

Android project **{{PROJECT_NAME}}** (`{{PACKAGE_BASE}}`). Key config files: `.mcp.json`,
`.claude/settings.json`, `CLAUDE.md`.

## Code Quality Baseline — ZERO TOLERANCE

- **Zero detekt baseline.** Do NOT generate a `detekt-baseline.xml` to silence violations.
  Fix violations at the source. Every `@Suppress` requires a `// SUPPRESS-RATIONALE:` comment
  on the immediately-preceding line explaining why suppression is justified. Rule 8 of the
  architecture tests enforces this at build time.

## Verification

```bash
./gradlew detekt
./gradlew :core:architecture-test:test --rerun-tasks
./gradlew :app:assembleDebug
./gradlew test
```

Run these after any Kotlin change. The architecture-test requires `--rerun-tasks` because
Konsist uses `scopeFromProduction()` which Gradle may otherwise skip.
